      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据测量和计算得出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$h=6.62\\times10^{-34}$焦耳·秒",
        "$=6.62\\times10^{-27}$尔格·秒，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这正是普朗克在研究热辐射现象时得出的数值. 用不同方法",
        "求出的普朗克常数在数值上的一致性，证明了物质在发射和",
        "吸收光时的不连续性的假设是正确的. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "114. 光子"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "光在发射和吸收时的行为就象具有能量$E=h\\nu$的粒子流",
        "一样. 每一份光出乎意料地非常象那种被称为粒子的东西. ",
        "光在发射和吸收时的这种特性叫做微粒性，光粒子本身叫做",
        "**光子**或**光量子**. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "光子象粒子一样，具有确定的一份能量$h\\nu$. 光子的能量",
        "常常不用频率$\\nu$表示，而用圆频率$\\omega=2\\pi\\nu$表示. 这时比例",
        "系数常常用量$\\hbar$（读作加横$h$）来代替$h$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\hbar=\\frac{h}{2\\pi}=1.05\\times10^{-34}$焦耳·秒",
        "$=1.05\\times10^{-27}$尔格·秒"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "而光子的能量可表达如下："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$E=h\\nu=\\hbar\\omega$ （10.4）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据相对论，能量与质量的关系永远是由关系式$E=mc^2$",
        "决定. 因为光子的能量等于$h\\nu$，所以光子的质量$m$可以如",
        "下求出："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$m=\\frac{h\\nu}{c^2}$ （10.5）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
